1
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:34,999
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:43,320
When was the last time
you had a dream?

4
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,280
Do you still remember...

5
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,680
what your dream was?

6
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,160
Jiangcheng,

7
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,080
a jewel on the eastern seaboard.

8
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,840
Hengshi Air...

9
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:57,000
is the best private airline
in Jiangcheng.

10
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,000
It's also where I've worked...

11
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,320
as a flight attendant
for three years.

12
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,440
A few years ago,

13
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,760
executives announced
the Soar Initiative.

14
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,480
Any employee,

15
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,520
regardless of their job,

16
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,040
could have the chance...

17
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,840
to become a company-sponsored pilot
as long as they passed the exams.

18
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,360
This was my best chance
to transition...

19
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,360
from a flight attendant to a pilot.

20
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,480
I went through rounds
of screening...

21
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,360
and finally received...

22
00:02:22,361 --> 00:02:24,120
an admission letter
from the aviation academy.

23
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,160
But the Soar Initiative...

24
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,159
was suddenly terminated...

25
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,160
by the new vice president,

26
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,360
Fu Ming Yu.

27
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:33,680
All the hard work I put in...

28
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,040
vanished in an instant.

29
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,360
Just when I thought...

30
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,200
it was all over,

31
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,120
Fu Ming Yu...

32
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,640
came back.

33
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:53,080
(Episode 1: A "Confession" Letter)

34
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:56,960
(Year 2017)

35
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,840
Ruan Ruan.

36
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,040
Gosh, you scared me to death!

37
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,040
Why are you walking so quietly?

38
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,320
What are you looking
for in the dark?

39
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,720
Where's the letter I wrote?

40
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,240
Letter?

41
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,400
What is this for?

42
00:03:34,401 --> 00:03:35,680
I put it in an envelope for you.

43
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,559
Just handing over two loose sheets
would look so insincere.

44
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,000
After all, he is the vice president.

45
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,280
Forget it. I'll just play it by ear.

46
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,440
I'm almost late. I have to go.

47
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,680
Wait.

48
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:44,760
I'll give you a ride.

49
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,800
Hurry! Helmet!

50
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,080
Give me the suitcase.

51
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:59,600
Find an intersection in a bit
and drop me off.

52
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,399
- I'll take a taxi from there.
- Don't worry.

53
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,400
I'll just step on the gas.

54
00:04:02,401 --> 00:04:03,440
Just hold on tight.

55
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:06,119
No, my hair will get all messed up.

56
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,199
You can fix it when you get there.

57
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,200
It's better than being late.

58
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,319
- Slow down!
- I've talked to my mentor.

59
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,999
When you give the letter
to Fu Ming Yu, she'll cover for you.

60
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,760
No, we're not that close.

61
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,240
Don't worry.

62
00:04:15,241 --> 00:04:16,679
My mentor may look cold,

63
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,720
but she's actually quite nice.

64
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,000
- We'll see.
- Stop saying that.

65
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,639
You've sent so many emails,
but none were answered.

66
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,640
Everything depends on today.

67
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,440
It wasn't easy to get
into the Soar Initiative.

68
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,679
Classes were about to start,
but Fu Ming Yu canceled the program.

69
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,920
Do you still want to be a pilot?

70
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,679
I said, we'll see!

71
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,120
I can't shout anymore.

72
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,080
- Hold on tight!
- Slow down!

73
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,080
Ask Wang Le Kang...

74
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,360
how the Inflight Operations Dept.
regulates the appearance...

75
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,840
of flight attendants.

76
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,080
Yes, Mr. Fu.

77
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:20,639
(Hengshi's Jiangcheng Base)

78
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,640
Good morning, Mr. Wang.

79
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,160
Ruan Si Xian.

80
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,240
- Hello, Mr. Wang.
- Your hair.

81
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,400
Do you want points deducted?
It was the wind.

82
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,920
Mr. Wang, I'll fix it right away.

83
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,400
On your way here,

84
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,160
did you see anyone
riding an electric scooter?

85
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,080
They don't even know
how to follow traffic rules.

86
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,120
- Well...
- Fine. Off you go.

87
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,560
- Ruan Ruan!
- What are you guys talking about?

88
00:05:55,561 --> 00:05:57,320
- There you are.
- Where's the purser?

89
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,400
Didn't you see the message?

90
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,800
The flight is delayed.

91
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,280
They're discussing...

92
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,720
how to outsmart Fu Ming Yu.

93
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,320
Outsmart him?

94
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,640
What did he do?

95
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,080
Haven't you heard?

96
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,999
You know that flight attendant
with the very fair skin?

97
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,720
Mr. Fu, please take a look at this.

98
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,480
She's about to get engaged...

99
00:06:16,481 --> 00:06:19,000
to the son of the chairman
of Zhengxi Steel.

100
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,040
Impressive, right?

101
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,960
I heard they first met...

102
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,880
on a flight.

103
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,919
Yes, it was love at first sight.

104
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,920
They hit it off right away.

105
00:06:27,921 --> 00:06:29,840
That's how they got together.

106
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,880
This gossip is so ridiculous.

107
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,480
Even idol dramas don't
use this plot anymore.

108
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:40,239
Ruan Ruan, don't you have a lot...

109
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,400
you want to say to Mr. Fu?

110
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,840
He just happened
to pick our flight.

111
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,880
It's a sign from above.
You must seize the chance.

112
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,800
So this is the result
of your recent reorganization?

113
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,040
That flight attendant
on an electric scooter this morning.

114
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,560
Did you find her?

115
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,640
I've been watching all morning,

116
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,280
but I haven't seen her.

117
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:07,960
I'll check with every squad.

118
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,320
I'll search thoroughly.

119
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,440
Once found, she will
be severely disciplined.

120
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:46,040
(Jiangcheng International Airport)

121
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,640
Hello.

122
00:08:21,641 --> 00:08:22,800
Please scan your face here.

123
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,600
Hello.

124
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,760
Hello, Mr. Fu.

125
00:08:53,761 --> 00:08:55,440
I'm Yue Yang,
the captain for this flight.

126
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,800
Welcome aboard.

127
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,080
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.

128
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,480
I'm doomed.

129
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,160
Look at his grumpy face.

130
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,400
It won't be easy
to deliver this letter.

131
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,280
Ladies and gentlemen,

132
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,559
thank you for waiting.

133
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,879
- Ms. Wang.
- For this flight...

134
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,479
Please fasten your seatbelt.
Thank you.

135
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,600
For your safety,

136
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,920
please stow your tray table...

137
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,200
Ms. Liu, please fasten
your seatbelt.

138
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,399
Switch your phone
to airplane mode. Thank you.

139
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,439
So that we don't disturb you...

140
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,440
during our final safety check,

141
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:37,559
please turn off your mobile phones
and other electronic devices...

142
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,280
or switch them to airplane mode.

143
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,840
Power banks and other
lithium battery portable chargers...

144
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,120
are prohibited
throughout the flight.

145
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,720
Thank you for your cooperation.

146
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,160
We wish you a pleasant journey.

147
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,240
He's being so dramatic
just for a flight.

148
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,840
So you're actually afraid of flying.

149
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,480
Mr. Fu, is our airline...

150
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,760
really going
to buy a large aircraft?

151
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,840
Domestic development
of large aircraft...

152
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,160
is the inevitable trend.

153
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,440
It's also something we must achieve.

154
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,640
That's why Hengshi must take
forward-looking actions...

155
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,200
to gain the industry's upper hand...

156
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,600
in the next three years.

157
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,840
Is that why you suddenly halted
the Soar Initiative?

158
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,320
Halting the Soar Initiative...

159
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:47,360
was to allow for more
targeted training of new pilots.

160
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,560
About the Soar Initiative,

161
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,960
Si Xiao Zhen told me everything.

162
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,440
You'll handle A1 today.

163
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,720
Thank you.

164
00:10:53,721 --> 00:10:55,480
About that letter for Mr. Fu,
you had better think it through.

165
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,839
If you get a complaint,
you'll be responsible.

166
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,840
Don't drag me down with you.

167
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,160
You...

168
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,840
are better off quitting your job.

169
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,959
With you thinking
about being a pilot all day,

170
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,960
how am I supposed to lead this team?

171
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,840
Go on.

172
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,080
Careful. The coffee is a bit hot.

173
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,200
Okay, thank you.

174
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,640
Coffee, please.

175
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,960
Certainly, Mr. Bai.

176
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,880
- Please enjoy.
- Thank you.

177
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:41,680
Mr. Fu,

178
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,240
would you...

179
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,920
like some coffee?

180
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,560
Mr. Fu,

181
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,040
you...

182
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,400
Do you no longer want to be...

183
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,560
a flight attendant at Hengshi?

184
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,400
Yes.

185
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,720
I don't want to be
a flight attendant anymore.

186
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,720
- I want to be...
- The boss's wife?

187
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:23,320
You're better off dreaming.

188
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:26,360
Don't forget that
you're still in a Hengshi uniform.

189
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:29,160
Can't you have some consideration
for Hengshi's image?

190
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:31,360
Mr. Fu, don't misunderstand.

191
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,920
This is about the Soar Initiative...

192
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,800
Daddy!

193
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,799
- Ladies and gentlemen.
- Daddy!

194
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:41,919
Please fasten your seatbelts.

195
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,360
Daddy!

196
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:46,599
Hey, little one.
Fasten your seatbelt. It's okay.

197
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,159
Passengers standing in the cabin,

198
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,440
please take
the nearest seat immediately.

199
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,680
Ensure your luggage is stowed...

200
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,760
and the overhead bins are closed.

201
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,720
Flight attendants, please be seated.

202
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:56,880
Mind your safety.

203
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:12,800
Sit tight.

204
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,720
How much longer do you plan...

205
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,320
to sit here?

206
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,040
You dropped your love letter!

207
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,999
Mr. Fu, let me explain.

208
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,000
No need for explanations.

209
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,400
Get your purser over here.

210
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,360
Mr. Fu, please take a look
at this letter.

211
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:18,880
Once you read it,

212
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:19,960
you'll understand everything.

213
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,720
This is absurd.

214
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,040
Mr. Fu,

215
00:14:38,041 --> 00:14:39,600
you weren't hurt
by the turbulence, were you?

216
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:43,119
I'm sorry for your bad experience
due to our lack of oversight...

217
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,520
regarding our flight attendants.

218
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,000
But don't worry.

219
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,960
We will definitely
strengthen our management.

220
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:50,240
Mr. Fu, we are truly sorry.

221
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,640
Please give us another chance
to make things right.

222
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:59,120
(Ma'ao)

223
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,400
Take care, Mr. Fu.

224
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,480
- Take care.
- Watch your step.

225
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:12,639
- See you.
- Bye.

226
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,959
- Thank you.
- Bye. Take care.

227
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,999
- Take care, little one.
- Bye.

228
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,560
- Bye.
- Bye.

229
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,360
Xuan, I'm at the airport.

230
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:55,920
At the arrivals level.

231
00:15:55,921 --> 00:15:57,240
- Wait for me.
- Sure.

232
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,400
- I'll wait for you at the entrance.
- All right.

233
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,760
- Okay.
- See you in a bit.

234
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,080
I must be seeing things.

235
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:10,440
Why is he everywhere?

236
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:18,640
Wait.

237
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,120
He wouldn't think
I'm stalking him, would he?

238
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,960
Ruan Ruan!

239
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,320
Xuan.

240
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,040
What's wrong?

241
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,680
Don't even ask.

242
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:36,920
That guy Fu Ming Yu...

243
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,920
He didn't even look
at the letter I wrote him.

244
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,000
He even thought I was harassing him.

245
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,360
All right.

246
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,200
Let's go. I'll take you out
to cheer you up tonight.

247
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:46,960
- Where to?
- To my boss's cocktail party.

248
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:50,560
Will there be handsome guys?

249
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,720
Of course.

250
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:22,560
Thank you so much.

251
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,880
You're the best.

252
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,320
Cheers.

253
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,880
You know what they say. The richer
they are, the stingier they are.

254
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:31,160
A little turbulence on a flight
is perfectly normal.

255
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,240
And yet, he's holding
a grudge against you.

256
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,080
I wouldn't say a grudge,

257
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:37,080
but he probably thinks
I'm a stalker.

258
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,560
Tell me, why is it that
whenever I try to do something,

259
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,600
it feels like the whole world
is making it difficult for me?

260
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,799
Should I just give up
and be a total slacker?

261
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:46,800
No way.

262
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:48,600
Based on the Ruan Si Xian I know,

263
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,960
even if she were a slacker,

264
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,840
she would be
the most hardworking one.

265
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,959
After sunning one side,

266
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,720
you would flip over
to sun the other side.

267
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,919
What are you talking about?

268
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,760
There's that smile.
You're finally smiling.

269
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,520
What's the occasion today?

270
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:02,760
Your boss invited so many people.

271
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,000
I don't know.

272
00:18:04,001 --> 00:18:06,240
My boss
loves hosting parties like this.

273
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,320
He likes a crowd.

274
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,840
But the guests must be important.

275
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:12,440
I heard it's
about the acquisition of WT Airport.

276
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:14,239
As for who they really are,

277
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:16,160
they certainly wouldn't
let a flight attendant like me know.

278
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,360
But one thing is for sure.

279
00:18:17,361 --> 00:18:18,640
They're all rich and powerful.

280
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,080
- Xuan.
- Yes?

281
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:22,360
Okay.

282
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,800
- My boss is here.
- Go ahead.

283
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,200
Boss.

284
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:29,520
I have to take this.

285
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,080
Chairman Fu is very angry.

286
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:38,320
Hello?

287
00:18:38,321 --> 00:18:40,720
Hengshi isn't your personal fiefdom.

288
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:43,040
You abolished the Soar Initiative?

289
00:18:43,320 --> 00:18:44,720
Who's going to be responsible...

290
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:46,080
for the initial investment costs?

291
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,719
Is the board just for show?

292
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,720
Please let me explain.

293
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:50,280
Reform is bound
to cause growing pains.
Fu Ming Yu.

294
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,120
You've only been
in office a few days.

295
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,880
Do you know how many people
have complained about you?

296
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,680
Take the earliest flight back
immediately.

297
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,240
Chairman Fu.
Yes, please listen to me.

298
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,160
Yes, he's been very busy lately.

299
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:07,960
Don't worry.

300
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:10,000
I'll book him
the earliest flight back tomorrow.

301
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:23,720
This is ridiculous.

302
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,679
- Mr. Fu.
- I have to say, you...

303
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:36,680
Mr. Fu, you've misunderstood.

304
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:38,119
I was invited here by a friend.

305
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,120
A friend?

306
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:40,480
Which friend?

307
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:41,800
Her boss is named...

308
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:45,400
What was his name again?

309
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:52,080
Mr. Fu, I won't
bother explaining anymore.

310
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,800
You haven't read this letter yet.

311
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,960
Please take a look at it...

312
00:19:55,040 --> 00:19:56,720
so you don't think
I have some ulterior motive.

313
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:57,880
Please stay away from me.

314
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,080
That sure was clumsy.

315
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,160
If I said today was
just a coincidence,

316
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,760
would you believe me?
Yes.

317
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,160
Of course I would.

318
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,520
I would even believe you could fly.

319
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:25,840
How can you be like this?

320
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,160
You aren't listening to me at all.

321
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:30,199
I just told you, today really was...

322
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:32,080
Being unreasonable is
just not interesting anymore.

323
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,279
These underhanded tactics
you're using...

324
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:36,399
are nothing I haven't seen before.

325
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:38,280
If you have
this much time and energy,

326
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,320
you should focus it
on your actual job.

327
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:48,120
Someone who's afraid of flying
wants to run an airline?

328
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:50,320
That's the biggest joke
I've heard all year.

329
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:57,640
So all this time,

330
00:20:58,320 --> 00:20:59,320
all this time,

331
00:20:59,321 --> 00:21:00,600
you thought I was harassing you?

332
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,520
How can you be so full of yourself?

333
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:04,840
What gives you the right to ignore
other people's hard work and effort?

334
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,320
Effort?

335
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:16,680
I think you just don't want
to work hard at all.

336
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,160
Go back to work.

337
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:45,800
Chairman Fu.

338
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,600
Actually, on your way back,

339
00:23:13,080 --> 00:23:14,080
half of my anger...

340
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:15,720
had already dissipated.

341
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:17,560
In the past,

342
00:23:17,800 --> 00:23:20,200
I was even more reckless
than you are.

343
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:22,720
But because of that temper,

344
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:26,680
I caused a lot of trouble
in my youth.

345
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,120
So,

346
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:30,960
I want to give you some advice.

347
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:33,880
Before making a major decision,

348
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:36,320
give yourself some time.

349
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:38,120
Don't rush into things.

350
00:23:38,480 --> 00:23:40,520
Always leave others some leeway.

351
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:44,600
This is the experience
I've gained...

352
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,360
from many setbacks over the years.

353
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:50,600
Dad, times have changed.

354
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:52,400
And I've thought it through.

355
00:23:52,760 --> 00:23:54,519
If Hengshi wants
to turn a loss into a profit,

356
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:55,840
reform is inevitable.

357
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:58,879
Some projects
that are no longer applicable,

358
00:23:58,880 --> 00:23:59,880
like the Soar Initiative,
for example...

359
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,000
Don't be in such a rush.

360
00:24:02,880 --> 00:24:04,200
Let me break it down for you.

361
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,920
How many people will be affected...

362
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,320
if the Soar Initiative is canceled?

363
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:10,520
Once the Soar Initiative
is canceled,

364
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:14,279
HR and Flight Ops'
year-long efforts...

365
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:16,240
surrounding this project...

366
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,400
will all be in vain.

367
00:24:20,120 --> 00:24:21,600
Do you think they won't
have grievances?

368
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,719
You'll need to work
with the aviation academy...

369
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,200
to terminate the training agreement.

370
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:26,360
Not to mention the penalty fees,

371
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:28,280
the communication costs are
already high.

372
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:30,600
Besides,

373
00:24:30,601 --> 00:24:31,759
the Soar Initiative was
Mr. Zhu's way...

374
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:33,319
of promoting the Hengshi spirit.

375
00:24:33,320 --> 00:24:35,200
He wanted
to address employees' dreams...

376
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:37,080
and provide everyone
with a fair chance...

377
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:39,200
to become a pilot.

378
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:41,160
The board also approved it.

379
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,679
Even though Zhu retired...

380
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:45,400
before you arrived,

381
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:47,040
if you do this,

382
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,560
it'll tarnish his legacy.

383
00:24:52,080 --> 00:24:53,480
Do you think he'll be happy?

384
00:24:55,320 --> 00:24:59,080
The heads of the Inflight Services,
Flight Ops, and HR Departments...

385
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:01,800
were all mentored by Zhu.

386
00:25:02,280 --> 00:25:04,400
Which part of your current work...

387
00:25:05,800 --> 00:25:07,720
isn't closely related
to these people?

388
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,720
All right.

389
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,520
I'll stay with you a bit longer.

390
00:25:17,280 --> 00:25:18,640
Think it over carefully,

391
00:25:19,600 --> 00:25:21,360
then tell me your final decision.

392
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:50,680
(Mr. Qin, Head of Admissions
at the Aviation Academy)

393
00:25:55,320 --> 00:26:00,840
(Mr. Qin, Head of Admissions
at the Aviation Academy)

394
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:12,760
Captain Fan.

395
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:14,920
Captain Fan,

396
00:26:15,320 --> 00:26:16,480
I'm not sure
if you still remember me.

397
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,720
My name is Ruan Si Xian.

398
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:19,040
For the Soar Initiative,

399
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,160
you were my interviewer.

400
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:21,320
I remember.

401
00:26:21,321 --> 00:26:22,360
What are you doing here?

402
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:24,160
I'm looking for someone.

403
00:26:25,360 --> 00:26:26,360
Did you find them?

404
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,720
No.

405
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,080
And you're here for...

406
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,240
I'm here to practice.

407
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,080
I'll head in first.

408
00:27:00,120 --> 00:27:01,120
Ruan Si Xian!

409
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:22,720
I'm bringing someone in.

410
00:27:22,760 --> 00:27:23,760
Okay.

411
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:28,720
- Open the gate.
- Go on in.

412
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:47,360
Well?

413
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:50,280
Is the Soar Initiative
still being canceled?

414
00:27:52,360 --> 00:27:53,440
Hengshi needs reform.

415
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,640
My stance...

416
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,640
has never changed.

417
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:10,320
Fine.

418
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:13,119
As for the board,

419
00:28:13,120 --> 00:28:14,360
I'll give them an explanation.

420
00:28:15,320 --> 00:28:16,640
The arrangements
for each department...

421
00:28:16,840 --> 00:28:18,600
and specific execution details...

422
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:20,200
will be your responsibility.

423
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:22,000
Okay.

424
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:28,920
I heard...

425
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,640
the Soar Initiative was canceled.

426
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,080
Captain Fan,

427
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,920
the Soar Initiative is
indeed canceled.

428
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,120
So the reason I'm here...

429
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,360
is to find out...

430
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:40,040
if I still have a chance
to learn to fly.

431
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:41,920
But I heard...

432
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:45,160
that our company's training program
with the aviation academy...

433
00:28:45,560 --> 00:28:46,920
has already been canceled.

434
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,839
Even if you received...

435
00:28:48,840 --> 00:28:50,880
an admission letter
for the Soar Initiative,

436
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,160
the academy might not accept you.

437
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,000
But I'm not here...

438
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:56,880
for a guaranteed result.

439
00:28:58,040 --> 00:28:59,040
I'm here for hope.

440
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,800
Even if there is
only a one percent chance,

441
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:02,040
I still want to try.

442
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:03,520
How?

443
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,240
What do you have in mind?

444
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:07,720
Find the admissions officer...

445
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,480
and fight for a chance to enroll.

446
00:29:10,320 --> 00:29:11,320
The admissions office?

447
00:29:12,600 --> 00:29:13,600
Did you find it?

448
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:16,120
No.

449
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,440
I couldn't get through
on the phone either.

450
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:19,080
That's why I came here.

451
00:29:19,360 --> 00:29:20,960
I think the fact
you couldn't get through...

452
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:22,360
reflects the academy's attitude.

453
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,000
It has little to do with...
whether you come here in person.

454
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:26,920
Two years ago, I never thought...

455
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:28,880
I would make it
into the Soar Initiative.

456
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:30,920
And to be honest,

457
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:32,360
I've already resigned...

458
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:33,840
from Hengshi.

459
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:38,920
Let's go.

460
00:29:39,200 --> 00:29:41,040
- Where to?
- Come to practice with me first.

461
00:29:41,560 --> 00:29:42,720
I'll take you
to the admissions office later.

462
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,200
Hello, Captain Fan.

463
00:31:14,520 --> 00:31:17,080
Dad, I want to be a pilot
when I grow up.

464
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:20,119
Then in the future, I'll only fly...

465
00:31:20,120 --> 00:31:21,600
on planes piloted by my little Ruan.

466
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:55,600
Mr. Qin.

467
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:56,960
- Mr. Qin.
- You're here.

468
00:31:58,120 --> 00:32:00,080
I'm here to ask you something.
Sorry to bother you.

469
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:03,200
Bother me? We were classmates
for four years.

470
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:05,120
I can't believe
you're being so polite.

471
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:07,240
Don't be a stranger. Have a seat.

472
00:32:07,280 --> 00:32:08,360
The thing is,

473
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:10,479
the admissions office phone
has been busy all the time.

474
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,920
So I had to come see you.

475
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,040
That's just how it is here.

476
00:32:13,320 --> 00:32:14,560
Once the holidays start,

477
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:15,920
the admissions office phone...

478
00:32:16,120 --> 00:32:17,400
is constantly busy.

479
00:32:17,760 --> 00:32:18,799
If you want to get through,

480
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:20,080
you need a bit of luck.

481
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,640
Here, have some water.

482
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:22,800
Don't trouble yourself.

483
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:24,200
- Please, sit.
- Sit down.

484
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:25,400
Let me introduce you.

485
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:26,920
This is Ruan Si Xian.

486
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:29,000
She's my colleague at Hengshi.

487
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:32,160
She also passed the interview
for the Soar Initiative.

488
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:35,120
She even received
the academy's admission letter.

489
00:32:35,520 --> 00:32:36,840
But since the project was canceled,

490
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:38,080
everything has been put on hold.

491
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:40,440
So I'm here to ask on her behalf.

492
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:41,880
Given her situation,

493
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:43,520
is there any room for maneuver?

494
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:45,080
How can there be any room?

495
00:32:45,760 --> 00:32:48,400
The entire training program
has stalled.

496
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:50,480
If we recruit students
and they graduate,

497
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:51,680
who will take them?

498
00:32:51,840 --> 00:32:54,440
As you know,
every takeoff and landing...

499
00:32:54,840 --> 00:32:55,840
costs money.

500
00:32:56,120 --> 00:32:57,239
Even if the plane stays
in the hangar,

501
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:58,440
it still costs money.

502
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,440
The training costs
for a single pilot...

503
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:02,440
are at least 700,000
to 800,000 yuan.

504
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:03,920
Since the airline...

505
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,760
is no longer paying the tuition,

506
00:33:06,080 --> 00:33:08,560
we certainly can't expect
the academy to bear the cost.

507
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,320
Are there still
self-funded students?

508
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:14,800
Self-funded students?

509
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:17,200
In the decades
since the school opened,

510
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,080
there have only been two.

511
00:33:19,280 --> 00:33:20,280
If you ask me,

512
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:21,800
for a woman,

513
00:33:22,120 --> 00:33:23,799
being a flight attendant
is quite good.

514
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:25,200
You still get to be in a plane.

515
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:28,120
Right. Of course,
you're an exception.

516
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,440
Out of dozens of people
in our class,

517
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:32,040
didn't only you
become a female captain?

518
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,560
But you should also know...

519
00:33:34,760 --> 00:33:37,000
that the pressure on a pilot
is simply immense.

520
00:33:37,280 --> 00:33:39,360
Just a few days ago,
one of our trainees...

521
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:42,360
was grounded
due to excessive mental stress.

522
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:50,640
I'm sorry.

523
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,000
I couldn't be of more help.

524
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,240
Captain Fan,

525
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:54,960
you've already helped me enough.

526
00:33:55,760 --> 00:33:56,760
Thank you.

527
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:58,920
As for the tuition,

528
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,680
I'll find a way.

529
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:08,360
Why are you so set
on learning to fly?

530
00:34:11,520 --> 00:34:12,640
Actually, before I met you,

531
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:15,240
I wasn't even that certain.

532
00:34:17,120 --> 00:34:18,720
I was just being stubborn,

533
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,400
determined to achieve...

534
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:23,000
the goal I've had
for the past two years.

535
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:25,400
After all,

536
00:34:25,560 --> 00:34:26,560
it has been my motivation...

537
00:34:26,640 --> 00:34:27,680
to keep going in the past two years.

538
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:29,480
I have to make it happen.

539
00:34:30,040 --> 00:34:31,360
But after seeing you today...

540
00:34:32,560 --> 00:34:34,200
and watching you pilot that plane...

541
00:34:35,640 --> 00:34:37,920
and soar right up
into the blue sky,

542
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,680
in that moment,

543
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:41,400
I felt like my dream...

544
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:43,040
suddenly became tangible.

545
00:34:44,120 --> 00:34:46,040
I felt like all my efforts
over the past two years...

546
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:47,320
weren't in vain.

547
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:48,800
I'm even more certain now...

548
00:34:49,080 --> 00:34:50,080
that I must become...

549
00:34:50,160 --> 00:34:51,280
the person I want to be.

550
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:52,840
It's just a matter of money.

551
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:55,960
I'll find a way.

552
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:58,160
Everyone is telling you...

553
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,480
it's impossible...

554
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:00,920
and that it won't work.

555
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,720
You should listen to reason.

556
00:35:04,600 --> 00:35:05,600
Why are you so stubborn?

557
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,160
Captain Fan,

558
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:09,280
I know you mean well.

559
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:11,880
But if everyone tells you...

560
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,520
that you can do it...

561
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:14,560
and that it's easy,

562
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,520
then the outcome is already known.

563
00:35:16,840 --> 00:35:17,880
What's the point in trying then?

564
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:19,840
Isn't a dream...

565
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,480
about turning the impossible...

566
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:23,120
into the possible?

567
00:35:27,360 --> 00:35:28,800
You still don't quite understand...

568
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:31,080
how hard this path is for a woman.

569
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:32,840
Captain Fan,

570
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,080
my life up until now...

571
00:35:36,120 --> 00:35:37,160
has always been hard.

572
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:41,000
I just have
to keep working hard, right?

573
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:43,680
I'll give it my best shot.

574
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:15,640
Ruan Si Xian
from Division Four has resigned.

575
00:36:16,240 --> 00:36:18,800
I heard that she didn't
get what she wanted on the plane.

576
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:19,960
After arriving in Ma'ao,

577
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:22,160
she kept pestering Mr. Fu.

578
00:37:31,240 --> 00:37:34,080
(Three Years Later)

579
00:37:36,520 --> 00:37:37,879
(Hengshi Air Board Meeting)

580
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:38,880
Hello, directors.

581
00:37:39,600 --> 00:37:40,600
May I begin?

582
00:37:45,720 --> 00:37:46,800
Please look at the screen.

583
00:37:49,200 --> 00:37:50,480
This is the Z101.

584
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:52,079
It's a domestic
commercial aircraft...

585
00:37:52,080 --> 00:37:53,440
developed independently
by our country.

586
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:55,440
Our purchase contract for it...

587
00:37:55,720 --> 00:37:57,560
has already entered
the final delivery phase.

588
00:37:58,040 --> 00:37:59,240
A domestic commercial aircraft...

589
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:01,480
is not only a milestone
in high-end manufacturing,

590
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,159
but also a key tool
for restructuring...

591
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:04,199
the global
aviation industry chain...

592
00:38:04,200 --> 00:38:06,400
and ensuring economic security.

593
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:08,000
Hengshi's introduction
of domestic aircraft...

594
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:09,640
is not only
strategically significant,

595
00:38:10,120 --> 00:38:11,160
but its economic prospects...

596
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:12,600
are also very promising.

597
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:17,320
Regarding the formation
of the Z101 flight crew,

598
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:19,039
Hengshi has already sent...

599
00:38:19,040 --> 00:38:20,720
its most senior captains
and instructors...

600
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:22,080
for type rating training.

601
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:24,520
They will then lead
the new pilots...

602
00:38:24,720 --> 00:38:25,760
in transition training.

603
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,599
This will also
greatly shorten the time...

604
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:28,760
from the delivery
of the new model...

605
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:30,640
to its official inaugural flight.

606
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:32,800
Let me say a few words.

607
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:35,760
Three years ago,

608
00:38:37,080 --> 00:38:39,680
due to a decline
in Hengshi's economic performance,

609
00:38:39,760 --> 00:38:41,760
the group had to adopt...

610
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:43,800
a cost-reduction
and efficiency strategy.

611
00:38:44,040 --> 00:38:46,000
Whether it was
halting the Soar Initiative...

612
00:38:46,080 --> 00:38:47,280
or laying off employees,

613
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,000
the cost reduction...

614
00:38:49,200 --> 00:38:50,960
brought great benefits to the group.

615
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,320
However,

616
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:54,040
in terms of efficiency,

617
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:57,240
we haven't seen
any significant results yet.

618
00:38:58,040 --> 00:39:00,200
So the introduction
of the new model...

619
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,880
is the perfect opportunity.

620
00:39:02,240 --> 00:39:04,280
I hope that
under Mr. Fu's leadership,

621
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:06,280
you can seize this opportunity,

622
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:08,040
actively handle the promotion,

623
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:09,840
and work hard to improve...

624
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,520
the group's efficiency.

625
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:14,760
I would also like to ask...

626
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:16,280
all the board members here...

627
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:17,800
to trust us.

628
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:20,200
Since you mentioned promotion,

629
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,800
next,

630
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,760
Zeng Yu
from the Publicity Department...

631
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:25,960
will present the detailed plans
and arrangements.

632
00:39:30,680 --> 00:39:33,960
For the promotion
of Hengshi's new aircraft model,

633
00:39:34,360 --> 00:39:36,680
we have already opened
the public bidding process.

634
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:38,440
After the first round of screening,

635
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:40,600
there are currently
three suppliers...

636
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,480
in the final pitch stage.

637
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,000
I believe...

638
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,600
that through our final efforts,

639
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:47,760
we will definitely have
a perfect implementation plan...

640
00:39:48,040 --> 00:39:49,440
ready before the inaugural flight.

641
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,640
We will certainly work tirelessly.

642
00:39:51,880 --> 00:39:53,079
The inaugural flight is set...

643
00:39:53,080 --> 00:39:54,080
for Hengshi's 20th anniversary,

644
00:39:54,081 --> 00:39:55,560
which is 68 days from now.

645
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:56,960
The selection of the supplier...

646
00:39:57,080 --> 00:39:58,840
will be completed within a week.

647
00:39:59,080 --> 00:40:00,240
The promotion and marketing plan...

648
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:02,160
will be finalized within 30 days.

649
00:40:02,600 --> 00:40:04,159
This is our current schedule.

650
00:40:04,160 --> 00:40:05,160
Sit down.

651
00:40:08,160 --> 00:40:09,160
Regarding the publicity plan,

652
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:11,280
the Publicity Department
and the Vice President's Office...

653
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,320
have already conducted research.

654
00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:13,720
Of the two airlines...

655
00:40:13,721 --> 00:40:15,600
that have already introduced
domestic aircraft,

656
00:40:16,040 --> 00:40:17,800
Jiangbei Airlines has implemented...

657
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,880
a strategy of domestic planes
paired with domestic catering...

658
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:22,360
and key domestic tourist routes.

659
00:40:22,640 --> 00:40:24,600
However, the results
did not meet expectations.

660
00:40:25,640 --> 00:40:26,640
The other airline,

661
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:28,000
Qinshan Airlines,

662
00:40:28,640 --> 00:40:30,400
updated their aircraft livery...

663
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:33,080
and customized themed uniforms
for the crew.

664
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:35,040
This generated a lot of buzz
on the internet.

665
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,640
It has a strong appeal
to young passengers.

666
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:39,680
This can serve
as a reference for Hengshi.

667
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,280
So...

668
00:40:52,280 --> 00:40:54,120
are you satisfied...

669
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:55,440
with these current proposals?

670
00:40:57,880 --> 00:40:58,880
They're not ideal.

671
00:40:58,920 --> 00:40:59,920
Fine.

672
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,320
Then I hope...

673
00:41:01,400 --> 00:41:04,480
Mr. Fu and Mr. Zeng's
Publicity Department...

674
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:05,960
will give this some serious thought.

675
00:41:06,280 --> 00:41:08,520
While introducing the new model,

676
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:10,920
we need to find an answer.

677
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,960
An answer that can...

678
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:16,680
save Hengshi Air at its roots.

679
00:41:58,800 --> 00:41:59,800
Fu Ming Yu,

680
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:01,199
how come I heard that...

681
00:42:01,200 --> 00:42:03,840
to promote your company's
new aircraft model,

682
00:42:04,040 --> 00:42:05,040
you're mistreating your staff?

683
00:42:05,200 --> 00:42:06,360
You won't even let them go home.

684
00:42:07,280 --> 00:42:08,440
Let me show you a video.

685
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:10,000
This is a female pilot...

686
00:42:10,040 --> 00:42:12,640
that Bo'ao is
about to sign a contract with.

687
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,000
This will wake you up.

688
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:24,560
(The Making of a Model Female Pilot,
Today's Takeoff Into the Skies)

689
00:42:31,640 --> 00:42:33,000
This female pilot is so cool!

690
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:35,760
Hey, gorgeous. Can I fly
on a plane you're piloting?

691
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,039
If a large domestic aircraft...

692
00:42:38,040 --> 00:42:39,080
is paired with a female pilot,

693
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,600
it would be incredibly cool!

694
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:43,000
If a female pilot is flying,

695
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:44,240
I'm definitely buying a ticket!

696
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:45,960
This female pilot's grades...

697
00:42:45,961 --> 00:42:47,280
are at the top of the class
at the Qindao Aviation Academy.

698
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,440
She's very famous.

699
00:42:52,680 --> 00:42:53,680
Mr. Yan,

700
00:42:53,960 --> 00:42:55,520
she's a student
at the Qindao Aviation Academy.

701
00:42:56,520 --> 00:42:58,079
How come I haven't heard
that your airline...

702
00:42:58,080 --> 00:42:59,320
is sponsoring a female pilot?

703
00:43:02,720 --> 00:43:04,079
She's not sponsored.

704
00:43:04,080 --> 00:43:05,080
She's the real deal.

705
00:43:05,440 --> 00:43:07,159
She's the top student
in the entire academy.

706
00:43:07,160 --> 00:43:08,160
Got it?

707
00:43:08,200 --> 00:43:10,200
Bo'ao must sign her today.

708
00:43:10,360 --> 00:43:12,960
Besides, I fell for her
at first sight.

709
00:43:13,680 --> 00:43:15,000
Just you wait, Fu Ming Yu.

710
00:43:22,240 --> 00:43:26,440
(Qindao Aviation Academy
Official Account)

711
00:43:34,240 --> 00:43:39,240
(Departing Ep. 1 for Ep. 2)
